- Jobs: public-facing. If you add or edit a job     
    here, it shows on the site’s Careers > Current    
    Vacancies page at /careers/vacancies. If someone  
    clicks Apply now, they either go to an external   
    apply link or to Alexandra’s own apply form.      
                                                      
  - Applications: private inbox only. When a candidate
    submits the careers form with a CV, it lands here.    This does not show publicly on the site.          
                                                      
  - Enquiries: private inbox only. Contact form       
    submissions and Book a visit submissions land     
    here. Parents do not see this section.            
                                                      
  - Availability Requests: private inbox only. The    
    Check availability form sends submissions here.   
                                                      
  - Events: public-facing. Add an event here and it   
    appears on /events.                               
                                                      
  - Testimonials: public-facing. These feed the What  
    Parents Say sections, mainly on the homepage and  
    nursery pages.                                    
                                                      
  - Nurseries: public-facing and important. Editing a 
    nursery affects multiple places: /nurseries, that 
    nursery’s own page like /nurseries/heston, branch 
    contact pages like /contact/heston, and shared    
    branch info such as contact details, fee-sheet    
    links, Ofsted/Food Hygiene data.                  
                                                      
  - Site Settings: global details. This is for overall    phone/email/hours and some shared brand-level     
    info. Some of these fields are used directly on   
    the site; some are partly wired and not shown     
    everywhere yet.                                   
                                                      
  - Media: file library. Uploaded images, PDFs, and CV    files live here.                                  
                                                      
  - Posts: currently not the main way to change the   
    public Alexandra site. The current blog/resources 
    page is not reading directly from normal WordPress    posts.                                            
                                                      
  - Pages: also not the real editor for the public    
    Alexandra pages. The visible pages are built in   
    React, not in normal WordPress page content.      
                                                  